			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- What is Branding Launch -->
	<section class="py-16 px-4 bg-black border-t border-[#1a1a1a]">
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
				What is a Clothing Brand Branding Service?
			</h2>
			<p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
				A clothing brand branding service is a complete visual identity build for your label — covering everything a buyer sees before they read a single word: your logo, color system, labels, hang tags, and packaging. Done together by one team, these elements create a cohesive brand language that feels intentional rather than assembled.
			</p>
			<p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
				The difference between a brand that sells and one that gets overlooked is rarely the product. It is almost always the presentation. A garment with a well-designed woven label, a clean hang tag, and branded packaging signals quality before anyone opens the bag. That signal is worth more than most founders expect — and it costs less than they assume.
			</p>
			<p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
				With {companyAge} of experience in garment manufacturing, we have worked with enough brands to know that branding decisions made at launch tend to stick. Getting it right from the start means you enter the market looking like you belong there — and you avoid the expensive, time-consuming process of rebranding a year in.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- What We Include -->
	<section id="whats-included" class="py-16 px-4 bg-black border-t border-[#1a1a1a]">
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
				What Does Our Clothing Brand Branding Service Include?
			</h2>
			<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-10">
				Six deliverables. One package. Everything your brand needs to look finished on day one.
			</p>

			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222]">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Logo Design</h3>
					<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
						Multiple concept directions developed from your brief. We present distinct ideas — not variations on one theme — and refine the chosen direction until the mark is exactly right. You receive files in every format you will ever need: AI, EPS, SVG, PNG, and PDF.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222]">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Brand Colors & Typography</h3>
					<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
						A defined color palette (with Pantone, CMYK, RGB, and HEX values) and a typeface system that holds up across print, digital, and physical product. This is what makes every touchpoint feel like it came from the same place.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222]">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Clothing Labels</h3>
					<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
						Woven main labels, printed care labels, and size labels — designed to match your brand and built to survive hundreds of washes. We design them, produce them, and sew them in during garment manufacturing. Nothing for you to source separately.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222]">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Hang Tags</h3>
					<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
						Custom-designed tags that carry your logo, brand voice, and any product information you want to communicate. The hang tag is the first physical thing a customer picks up — it should feel considered, not like an afterthought.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222]">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Packaging Design</h3>
					<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
						Branded poly bags, mailer boxes, and tissue wrapping designed around your identity. For e-commerce brands, unboxing is part of the product experience — and it is often what gets shared on social media. We make it worth sharing.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222]">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Brand Guidelines Document</h3>
					<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
						A clear, usable PDF covering logo usage rules, color codes, typeface guidance, and do's and don'ts. Hand it to any designer, printer, or social media manager anywhere in the world and get consistent results every time.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- How It Works — Timeline -->
	<section class="py-16 px-4 bg-black border-t border-[#1a1a1a]">
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
				How Does the Branding Process Work?
			</h2>
			<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-10">
				From first conversation to branded garments in your hands — here is exactly what happens and when.
			</p>

			<div class="space-y-1">
				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222] flex gap-6">
					<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 pt-1">
						<div class="text-[#e00] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Week 1</div>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Brand Discovery Call</h3>
						<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
							We start by listening. Who are your customers? What do you want people to feel when they see your label? What brands do you admire — and which do you want nothing to do with? This call shapes every design decision that follows. We will also confirm your timeline, production requirements, and any existing brand elements we should build around.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222] flex gap-6">
					<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 pt-1">
						<div class="text-[#e00] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Weeks 2–3</div>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Design Concepts & Refinement</h3>
						<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
							Our designers develop 2–3 genuinely different directions for your logo, labels, and packaging — each grounded in your brief, each a real option rather than a filler. You review, you react, and we refine. This stage continues until every element is exactly what you want. We do not rush it, and we do not charge extra for revisions.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222] flex gap-6">
					<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 pt-1">
						<div class="text-[#e00] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Week 4</div>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Physical Production</h3>
						<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
							Approved designs move straight into production. Woven labels, care labels, size labels, hang tags, and packaging are manufactured in our facility using materials that hold up in the real world — not just in mockups. Every piece goes through quality inspection before it touches a garment.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222] flex gap-6">
					<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 pt-1">
						<div class="text-[#e00] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Weeks 5–6</div>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Integration & Dispatch</h3>
						<p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
							Branding is applied during garment production — labels are sewn in, hang tags attached, packaging sealed. Your order leaves our facility as a finished, retail-ready product. Nothing left for you to assemble, attach, or coordinate from another supplier.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Pricing / Bangladesh Advantage -->
	<section class="py-16 px-4 bg-black border-t border-[#1a1a1a]">
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8">
				How Much Does a Clothing Brand Branding Service Cost?
			</h2>

			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#222]">
					<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-4">US or EU branding agency</h3>
					<div class="space-y-3 text-white/70 text-sm">
						<div class="flex justify-between"><span>Logo design</span><span class="text-white">$800 – $3,000</span></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between"><span>Label design</span><span class="text-white">$500 – $1,500</span></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between"><span>Hang tag design</span><span class="text-white">$300 – $800</span></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between"><span>Packaging design</span><span class="text-white">$600 – $2,000</span></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between"><span>Brand guidelines</span><span class="text-white">$500 – $2,000</span></div>
						<div class="border-t border-[#2a2a2a] pt-3 flex justify-between font-bold">
							<span class="text-white">Total</span>
							<span class="text-[#e00]">$2,700 – $9,300</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-3">Physical label and packaging production not included — sourced separately.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-[#111] p-6 border border-[#e00]">
					<div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#e00] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">SDF Clothing — Bangladesh</div>
					<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-4">Complete branding launch package</h3>
					<div class="space-y-3 text-white/70 text-sm">
						<div class="flex justify-between"><span>Logo design</span><span class="text-white">✓ Included</span></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between"><span>Label + hang tag design</span><span class="text-white">✓ Included</span></div>
